{"seq":1,"slug":"spring-and-autumn-era","title":"春秋乱世","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-warring-times","title":"春秋的乱世","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era/the-warring-times","wordCount":1784,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-strategist-is-born","title":"军事家的诞生","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/spring-and-autumn-era/a-strategist-is-born","wordCount":1710,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 春秋乱世\n\n本章讲述孙子所处的春秋乱世与其军事家的诞生。春秋末期，诸侯争霸、战乱频仍，为军事思想的孕育，提供了土壤；正是这样一个时代，造就了孙子这位旷世的军事天才。两篇文档，分别呈现春秋的乱世，以及军事家的诞生。\n"}